shotclip (1.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Screencasts: recordings from the GNOME screenshot tool show up in the
    picker, are converted from WebM to MP4 with ffmpeg (with a progress bar,
    automatic or on request) and are pasted as a file.
  * Play screencasts inside the picker (Space or the play button).
  * Video files copied in Files are recorded.
  * Light, dark or automatic style in Preferences.
  * Fix: opening a dropdown in Preferences closed the picker.

